 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在创建虚拟环境时，指定 python 版本：(否则的话很有可能就是创建的 python3)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "conda create -n myenv python=3.8"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "已经安装了 python/python3，需要安装 pip:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "curl https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py -o get-pip.py\n",
    "\n",
    "python get-pip.py"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "确保安装在正确的路径里："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "python -m pip install [module]\n",
    "python -m pip install ."
   ]
  }
 ],
